        "surveyDate": "1984-09-13",
        "surveyID": "109046",
        "narrative": "<p>The 1984 assessment showed average numbers of northern pike, sucker, bluegill, and rock bass and below average populations of cisco, perch, and walleye. One burbot was taken. Age class analysis of walleyes does not indicate any especially large year classes, but does not show low levels of walleyes from ages I-VI.</p>"
